">III</span><span data-text=\"consuli\" data-n=\"115\" data-lemma=\"consul\">CONSULI</span><span data-text=\"III\" data-n=\"120\" data-lemma=\"III\">III</span><span data-text=\"locus\" data-n=\"125\" data-lemma=\"locus\">LOCUS</span><span data-text=\"datus\" data-n=\"130\" data-lemma=\"do\">DATUS</span><span data-text=\"decreto\" data-n=\"135\" data-lemma=\"decretum\">DECRETO</span><span data-text=\"decurionum\" data-n=\"140\" data-lemma=\"decurio\">DECURIONUM</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>text of CIL</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5677-4679\">Alessandra Rocchetti</a></p>  <p>All'imperatore Caesare Traiano Adriano Augusto, figlio del divo Traiano Partico, pontefice massimo, nella sua terza tribunicia potesta, console per la terza volta. Luogo concesso per decreto dei decurioni.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5677-4679\">Alessandra Rocchetti</a></p>  <p>For the emperor Caesar Trajan Hadrian Augustus, son of the deified Trajan Parthicus, chief priest, holder of the tribunician powers for the third time, consul for the third time. The place was given by decree of the town councillors.</p>  <div><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>  </p>  </div>  <div><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li></li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/books/CILv10pII1883\" target=\"_blank\">7202</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1988 74 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
